EastSun 1005:
- "如果已經編譯過了 請按下F5的時候 就直接啟動軟體": lib/uptodate.js check(exe, tree)
  -- build when the exe is missing / under 64 KB / older than its build
  folder's CMakeCache.txt / Makefile / build.ninja / older than any source
  (.cpp .h .hpp .c .cc .inc .inl .def .rc .cmake CMakeLists.txt; build*, tests,
  docs, .git, .vscode, .claude skipped; 1751 files here, about 1 s). The cppdbg
  resolve hook (after freeProgram) calls Hub.skipBuildIfUpToDate: up to date =
  the preLaunchTask becomes the compound's last part that is not a build (here
  the wait page -- the old-program check is done by freeProgram), a plain build
  task none. Decision in the log. run.skipBuildWhenUpToDate.
- "我在編譯的時候 圖片開始按鈕怎沒有跟之前一樣轉圈圈變顏色了": RunBar.snapshot()
  used the old state (F5's build = idle); now curState(), like update().

Tests: run_all 3/3 layers (lib 187: uptodate cases; extension 236: the skip,
the kept wait page, a newer source builds, the setting; snapshot state);
real VS Code 156/159 (the 3 known stale checks).

