+  /**
+   * F5 (EastSun 1005: "如果已經編譯過了 請按下F5的時候 就直接啟動軟體"): the program already built and no source newer than it
+   * (lib/uptodate.js; a build folder whose CMake files changed builds) -> its preLaunchTask without the build: of a
